  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic:** **Second Number = (First Number × First Number) + (Third Number − 1)**.\n\nFor, **(16, 262, 7)**\n\n⇒ 16 × 16 = 256\n\n⇒ 256 + (7 − 1) = 256 + 6 = 262\n\nFor, **(40, 1612, 13)**\n\n⇒ 40 × 40 = 1600\n\n⇒ 1600 + (13 − 1) = 1600 + 12 = 1612\n\nNow, checking the options using the same pattern:\n\nOption 1) (8, 72, 4)\n\n⇒ 8 × 8 = 64\n\n⇒ 64 + (4 − 1) = 64 + 3 = 67 ≠ 72\n\nOption 2) (7, 74, 21)\n\n⇒ 7 × 7 = 49\n\n⇒ 49 + (21 − 1) = 49 + 20 = 69 ≠ 74\n\nOption 3) (36, 1318, 18)\n\n⇒ 36 × 36 = 1296\n\n⇒ 1296 + (18 − 1) = 1296 + 17 = 1313 ≠ 1318\n\n**Option 4) (4, 38, 23)**\n\n⇒ 4 × 4 = 16\n\n⇒ 16 + (23 − 1) = 16 + 22 = 38\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 4.**",
